---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import DogGallery from '../components/DogGallery.astro';
import { facebook } from '../config/site';
import { path } from '../config/paths';
import happy from '../assets/photos/happy.jpg';
import peter from '../assets/photos/peter.jpg';
import rambo from '../assets/photos/rambo.jpg';
---
<Base current="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Dog rescue · Ratchaburi, Thailand</p>
        <h1>Helping the street dogs of Thailand, one dog at a time.</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Dogs’ Best Friend Rescue takes in sick, injured and unwanted dogs, treats them, and gives them a safe place to live.
          Some find new families. Others stay with us for life.
        </p>
        <p>
          We’ve rescued numerous adult dogs and puppies with underlying health issues. We’re a small rescue, and your support pays
          for the food, vet care and daily work that keeps the shelter going.
        </p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-donate" href={path('/donate/')}>Help keep the rescue running</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href={facebook.url} rel="noopener">See the dogs on Facebook</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-photo">
        <Image src={happy} alt="Happy, a tan rescue dog with a big smile, sitting on grass with a red lead" widths={[480, 800, 1000]} sizes="(min-width: 860px) 45vw, 100vw" loading="eager" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sand">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Where your money goes</p>
      <h2>Running a shelter costs money every single day</h2>
      <p class="lead narrow" style="margin-inline:0">
        Rescue isn’t only about emergencies. The dogs need feeding, treating and caring for every day of the year,
        whether or not anyone is donating that month.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-4" style="margin-top:24px">
        <div class="card"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🩺</span><h3>Vet care</h3><p>Treatment, medication and emergencies for sick and injured dogs.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🥣</span><h3>Food</h3><p>Feeding every dog at the shelter, every day.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">💡</span><h3>Shelter running costs</h3><p>Electricity and the everyday costs of keeping the shelter going.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><span class="icon" aria-hidden="true">🤝</span><h3>A carer’s wage</h3><p>Monthly wages for the staff member who helps look after the dogs.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:28px"><a class="btn btn-donate" href={path('/donate/')}>See how you can help</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap split">
      <Image src={peter} alt="Peter and Khung standing on a city street, Khung holding a small black fluffy dog" widths={[400, 720]} sizes="(min-width: 820px) 45vw, 100vw" />
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Who we are</p>
        <h2>Started by Peter and Khung</h2>
        <p>
          Peter first started rescuing dogs in Thailand when he and his wife Khung found Beagle puppies being dumped at local
          markets because they hadn’t sold or had health problems. He rescued over 50 of those puppies and found homes for them.
        </p>
        <p>
          From 2016 Peter fostered dogs at home. Not every dog can be rehomed, and the number at home grew, so he rented farmland
          away from the city where the dogs could live more freely. That became Dogs’ Best Friend Rescue in Ratchaburi.
        </p>
        <a href={path('/about/')}>Read our story</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sand">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">A rescue story</p>
        <h2>Rambo</h2>
        <p>
          Rambo was one of the more fortunate rescues. After his care at Dogs’ Best Friend Rescue, he was adopted and now lives
          with his family in America.
        </p>
        <p>Not every dog has an ending like Rambo’s, but every one of them gets fed, treated and cared for, thanks to people who give.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-donate" href={path('/donate/')}>Help the next dog</a>
      </div>
      <Image src={rambo} alt="Rambo, a black and tan puppy, walking across the dirt at the shelter" widths={[480, 960]} sizes="(min-width: 820px) 45vw, 100vw" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Some of the dogs we’ve cared for</p>
      <h2>Real dogs, real care</h2>
      <p>These are some of the dogs the rescue has looked after. For the dogs at the shelter right now, follow us on Facebook.</p>
      <DogGallery />
      <p style="margin-top:24px"><a href={facebook.url} rel="noopener">See today’s dogs on Facebook →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-brown">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Other ways to help</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div>
          <h3>Become a member</h3>
          <p>Join the Association, from The Pups to The Great Dane. <a href={path('/membership/')}>See membership levels</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Sponsor a dog</h3>
          <p>Support the care of a dog who needs expensive treatment or can’t be adopted. <a href={path('/get-involved/#sponsor')}>About sponsoring</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Adopt</h3>
          <p>No adoption fees, and we can help with relocation. <a href={path('/get-involved/#adopt')}>Adopt, don’t shop</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Fly with a dog</h3>
          <p>Travelling to the USA, Canada or Europe? Help an adopted dog reach their new family. <a href={path('/get-involved/#fly')}>Become a flight volunteer</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Volunteer</h3>
          <p>An expert pooper scooper, walker and master of play is always needed. <a href={path('/get-involved/#volunteer')}>Lend a hand</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Share us</h3>
          <p>Follow and share the rescue’s <a href={facebook.url} rel="noopener">Facebook posts</a>. It costs nothing and helps more people find the dogs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
